    text: "Affected stops:\r\nLouisiana / Pearl Station Gate A (#15056) (northbound)\r\nS Downing St & Louisiana Ave (#13418) (northbound)\r\nS Downing St & Mississippi Ave (#13423) (northbound)\r\nS Downing St & Kentucky Ave (#13416) (northbound)\r\nS Downing St & Exposition Ave (#13403) (northbound)\r\nS Downing St & Virginia Ave (#13429) (northbound)\r\nS Downing St & Alameda Ave (#13388) (northbound)\r\nS Downing St & Bayaud Ave (#13393) (northbound)\r\nDowning St & Speer Blvd (#13426) (northbound)\r\nDowning St & 4th Ave (#13384) (northbound)\r\nDowning St & 6th Ave (#13385) (northbound)\r\nCorona St & 6th Ave (#13184) (southbound)\r\nCorona St & 4th Ave (#13183) (southbound)\r\nDowning St & Speer Blvd S (#13434) (southbound)\r\nS Downing St & Bayaud Ave (#13392) (southbound)\r\nS Downing St & Alameda Ave (#13389) (southbound)\r\nS Downing St & Virginia Ave (#13428) (southbound)\r\nS Downing St & Exposition Ave (#13402) (southbound)\r\nS Downing St & Mississippi Ave (#13422) (southbound)\r\n\nFor northbound Route 12 get on/off buses at:\r\nS Pearl St & Florida Ave (#15800)\r\nDowning St & 8th Ave (#13386)\r\n\nFor southbound Route 12 get on/off buses at:\r\nCorona St & 8th Ave (#13185)\r\nLouisiana Ave & S Downing St Farside (#33012)"
